Third-party dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

fleet-serving vendors no third-party source. Dependencies are resolved through
the Go module system and carry their own licenses, recorded in each module's
go.mod within go.sum alongside its version. The direct dependencies of this
module as of this commit:

    github.com/zlogic-labs/fleet/core     Apache-2.0  (Fleet, this organisation)
    k8s.io/api                            Apache-2.0
    k8s.io/apimachinery                   Apache-2.0
    k8s.io/client-go                      Apache-2.0
    sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime        Apache-2.0

Add any newly introduced direct dependency to this list in the same commit that
introduces it.
